WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.559
Once upon a time, Chinese economic performance
wasn't global news.

00:00:05.559 --> 00:00:07.759
Those days are long gone.

00:00:07.759 --> 00:00:13.499
The country's growth rate now acts as an indicator
for the health of the entire world's economy.

00:00:13.499 --> 00:00:19.420
No wonder then that this announcement was
so hotly anticipated:

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:27.660
According to preliminary estimates, the total
value of China's GDP was 90.03 trillion yuan,

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:32.150
a 6.6-percent year-on-year increase as calculated
by comparable price.

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:36.520
That outstripped the anticipated goal of around
6.5 percent.

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:37.630
6.6 percent.

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:42.430
It may not sound too shabby.

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:47.080
But take a look at this:
A decade ago, Chinese economic growth was

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.550
hovering around 10 percent.

00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:53.570
In the years since then, it's slowed steadily
.. And what's worrying investors is that no

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:57.320
one knows when that decline is going to end.

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:00.670
The reasons for China's slowdown are manifold.

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:05.990
Domestic issues, like a slowing property market
are putting pressure on growth.

00:01:05.990 --> 00:01:10.479
But even more worrying to the global markets
is the continuing trade dispute with the United

00:01:10.479 --> 00:01:12.310
States.

00:01:12.310 --> 00:01:16.140
The two countries are currently holding a
90-day trade truce which their leaders agreed

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:21.240
to after dining together at the G20 summit
in Argentina back in November.

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:24.250
Further trade talks are set to take place
at the end of January.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:29.079
But after months of volatility, the prospect
of a resolution is far from certain.

00:01:29.079 --> 00:01:57.170
A further escalation could have a dramatic
impact on the Chinese economy - and by extension

00:01:57.170 --> 00:02:43.750
the rest of the world too.

